<title>UK: Marley 1996 pretax profit 85.0 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Marley 1996 pretax profit 85.0 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		9.4		    vs 8.8</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 5.0		    vs 4.7</p>
<p> Pretax		     85.0		   vs 46.3</p>
<p> Turnover		   677.4		  vs 637.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Profit and earnings figures include exceptional items in both years, including a 41.7 million stg gain on disposals in 1996. Operating profits from continuing operations rose by 12 percent in the year.</p>
<p>Full company name - Marley Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
